            <field name="sequence">50</field>
            <field name="mastery_threshold">0.9</field>
            <field name="prerequisite_ids" eval="[(4, ref('demo_node_functions'))]"/>
            <field name="description"><![CDATA[
<h3>Python Modules</h3>
<p>Modules let you organize and reuse code across files:</p>
<ul>
    <li><code>import module_name</code>: Import an entire module</li>
    <li><code>from module import function</code>: Import specific items</li>
    <li><code>import module as alias</code>: Import with alias</li>
    <li>The <code>__name__</code> variable and <code>if __name__ == "__main__"</code> guard</li>
</ul>
<p>Python's standard library includes hundreds of useful modules like <code>os</code>, <code>sys</code>, <code>json</code>, <code>math</code>, etc.</p>
            ]]></field>
        </record>

